# Citation metadata for AOMB — no invented paper DOI / AUROC.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use AOMB, please cite this GitHub repository (URL + date accessed).
  There is no published paper DOI for AOMB yet — do not invent one.
type: software
title: Autonomous Observability Model Breeder
authors:
  - family-names: Pandey
    given-names: Abhinav
repository-code: "https://github.com/pandeyaby/AOMB"
url: "https://github.com/pandeyaby/AOMB"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  AOMB breeds an Infrastructure Language Model (ILM) — next-token prediction
  on observability telemetry. Companion DIPTYCH (separate product) grades
  2-safety / calibration on paired probes; AOMB emits fixtures, DIPTYCH grades.
  Do not merge the products. Lab AUROC stays not_published.
keywords:
  - observability
  - infrastructure language model
  - anomaly detection
  - DIPTYCH companion
references:
